Overlays.pak
============

launch.sh is original Zlyme (MIT below). It follows NextUI pak
conventions (https://github.com/LoveRetro/NextUI/blob/main/PAKS.md)
and installs overlays from LoveRetro/nextui-community-overlays.

Required Notice: Copyright LoveRetro/NextUI contributors (https://github.com/LoveRetro/NextUI).
Required Notice: Originally MinUI by Shaun Inman (https://github.com/shauninman/MinUI).
Required Notice: Licensed under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0.
https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0

This pak is not NextUI source. Do not treat launch.sh as relicensing
NextUI. NextUI remains PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0
(package/system/nextui/src/LICENSE).

Overlay images
--------------
https://github.com/LoveRetro/nextui-community-overlays
Rights stay with each overlay's original creator. That repo is not
under one license.

minui-list / minui-presenter
----------------------------
Copyright (c) 2025 Jose Diaz-Gonzalez, MIT
https://github.com/josegonzalez/minui-list
https://github.com/josegonzalez/minui-presenter

On this image they are linked against NextUI (PolyForm Noncommercial
1.0.0). See /usr/share/nextui/LICENSE, /usr/share/nextui/NOTICE,
package/system/minui-list/LICENSE, and
package/system/minui-presenter/LICENSE.

